  "version": 1,
  "status": "published",
  "description_nl": "One row per asset type (2026-09-24 owner: 'like Excel, Word and PowerPoint - one product, one standard'). screen = the menu screen that owns it (and whose access guards it); name_field / name_max = what Rename changes; words = the keys of that screen's words (ui.<screen>) the shared Home and New dialog show; fields = the New form (kind text | textarea | select, options = a list the screen passes in, required, max); file = the file New takes (required or not, accept = the screen's list of extensions); export / import = the pack routes ('' = none). A new type = a row here + its doors in assets.py. 2026-09-28 owner: 'browse a Doodle to create a comic book or film...' - `makes` = the types this one can become (Make into on its card; its story text becomes the new asset's source), `keep` = the key its screen reopens. cover_kind / cover_field (2026-09-29 owner: 'add covers to the home page cards'): a type's Home card shows its own picture - cover_kind = the Katha kind whose first picture it is (katha.cover_path), cover_field = a picture address on the record (a YouTube thumbnail); neither = the drawn cover (core ui.js coverArt). publish (2026-09-30 owner: 'Publish & Circles on every module'): the Katha kind this type publishes as - a Publish & Circles button on its Home card and its file bar opens the publish dialog with it chosen. deck (2026-09-30 owner: 'convert Comic, Doodle and Avatar as pdf and power point deck ... from the file bar, on a card, select multiple cards ... or save into another module called Decks'): true = a 'PDF & PowerPoint' button on its Home card and file bar, and Select on its Home (core ui.js assetHome) - Download PDF, Download PowerPoint, Save to Decks.",
  "weight_basis": "Owner 2026-09-24: product standardisation - chips and ops only.",
